  "prompt": "You are an expert frontend developer and UI designer. Create a single-page, standalone HTML document containing a complex, animated \"System Monitor\" dashboard with a heavy Cyberpunk / Sci-Fi aesthetic.\n\nSTRICT TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS:\n1. ALL HTML, CSS, and JavaScript must be contained within a single file. Do not import external libraries (no React, no Tailwind, no external CSS). You may use Google Fonts (e.g., 'Share Tech Mono' or 'Orbitron').\n2. Do NOT output markdown code blocks (```html). Start exactly with <!DOCTYPE html> and end with </html>.\n\nLAYOUT SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The layout must feature a permanent, fixed sidebar on the left side (approx 250px wide) containing a futuristic user profile and at least four functional-looking navigation buttons.\n2. The main content area must utilize a responsive CSS Grid structure to display at least three distinct data panels.\n\nAESTHETIC & GEOMETRIC SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The color palette must be dark mode: deep black backgrounds (#050505), with neon cyan, hot magenta, and toxic green accents.\n2. To achieve a seamless Sci-Fi look, the primary data panels must feature an inward-curving top corner (a custom border-radius or clip-path cut-out), giving it a highly structured, non-boxy appearance.\n3. Include a subtle, semi-transparent CSS \"scanline\" overlay across the entire viewport to simulate a CRT monitor.\n\nANIMATION & INTERACTIVITY SPECIFICATIONS (JavaScript required):\n1. Glitch Effect: The main dashboard header text must feature a CSS keyframe animation that occasionally \"glitches\" (splitting colors or offsetting text for a split second).\n2. Live Telemetry: One of the grid panels must contain a \"CPU/RAM Load\" bar chart or circular progress indicator. Use JavaScript to randomly update these values and animate the bars/circles every 800 milliseconds.\n3. Terminal Output: Another panel must act as a terminal window. Use JavaScript to automatically append simulated, matrix-style data logs (e.g., \"0x00FF... BYPASSING SECURITY...\") that scroll continuously.\n\nEnsure the final output is visually stunning, responsive, and immediately interactive upon loading.\n",
  "rawOutput": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>NEXUS // SYSTEM MONITOR v4.7.2</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Share+Tech+Mono&family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n*, *::before, *::after {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n:root {\n  --cyan: #00f0ff;\n  --magenta: #ff00aa;\n  --green: #39ff14;\n  --yellow: #ffe600;\n  --orange: #ff6a00;\n  --bg-dark: #050505;\n  --bg-panel: #0a0a12;\n  --bg-panel-light: #0f0f1a;\n  --border-color: #1a1a2e;\n  --text-dim: #4a4a6a;\n  --text-mid: #7a7a9a;\n  --sidebar-width: 260px;\n}\n\nhtml, body {\n  height: 100%;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n  background: var(--bg-dark);\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  display: flex;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n/* SCANLINE OVERLAY */\nbody::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0; left: 0;\n  width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n    0deg,\n    transparent,\n    transparent 2px,\n    rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.015) 2px,\n    rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.015) 4px\n  );\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 9999;\n}\n\nbody::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0; left: 0;\n  width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 50%, transparent 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 100%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 9998;\n}\n\n/* SIDEBAR */\n.sidebar {\n  width: var(--sidebar-width);\n  min-width: var(--sidebar-width);\n  height: 100vh;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #08080f 0%, #0a0a14 50%, #060610 100%);\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  padding: 0;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 10;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n}\n\n.sidebar::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0; right: 0;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--cyan), transparent 30%, transparent 70%, var(--magenta));\n  opacity: 0.5;\n}\n\n.profile-section {\n  padding: 24px 20px 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.profile-section::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: -1px;\n  left: 20%;\n  width: 60%;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--cyan), transparent);\n}\n\n.avatar-ring {\n  width: 80px;\n  height: 80px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  margin: 0 auto 14px;\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.avatar-ring::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: -3px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: 2px solid var(--cyan);\n  animation: avatarPulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n.avatar-ring::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: -8px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: 1px solid transparent;\n  border-top-color: var(--magenta);\n  animation: avatarSpin 6s linear infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes avatarPulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,240,255,0.2); }\n  50% { opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,240,255,0.5); }\n}\n\n@keyframes avatarSpin {\n  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n}\n\n.avatar-inner {\n  width: 70px;\n  height: 70px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #1a1a3a, #0a0a1a);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n\n.avatar-inner svg {\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  fill: none;\n  stroke: var(--cyan);\n  stroke-width: 1.5;\n}\n\n.profile-name {\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: #fff;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.profile-role {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  letter-spacing: 3px;\n  color: var(--magenta);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.profile-status {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: var(--green);\n}\n\n.status-dot {\n  width: 6px;\n  height: 6px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--green);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--green);\n  animation: statusBlink 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes statusBlink {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  50% { opacity: 0.3; }\n}\n\n/* NAV */\n.nav-section {\n  padding: 16px 12px;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.nav-label {\n  font-size: 9px;\n  letter-spacing: 4px;\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 0 8px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.nav-btn {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: 1px solid transparent;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  color: var(--text-mid);\n  font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  position: relative;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.nav-btn::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  top: 0;\n  width: 2px;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: var(--cyan);\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: opacity 0.3s;\n}\n\n.nav-btn:hover, .nav-btn.active {\n  background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.04);\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);\n}\n\n.nav-btn:hover::before, .nav-btn.active::before {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.nav-btn.active {\n  background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.06);\n}\n\n.nav-icon {\n  width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.nav-btn .badge {\n  margin-left: auto;\n  background: rgba(255, 0, 170, 0.15);\n  color: var(--magenta);\n  font-size: 9px;\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 170, 0.3);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n}\n\n/* SIDEBAR FOOTER */\n.sidebar-footer {\n  padding: 16px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.sidebar-footer .version {\n  color: var(--text-mid);\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.sidebar-footer .uptime {\n  color: var(--green);\n}\n\n/* MAIN CONTENT */\n.main-content {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n/* HEADER */\n.header {\n  padding: 16px 28px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,10,20,0.9), transparent);\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 64px;\n}\n\n.header::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: -1px;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--cyan) 20%, var(--cyan) 80%, transparent);\n  opacity: 0.3;\n}\n\n.header-left {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.header-title {\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: 4px;\n  color: #fff;\n  position: relative;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.header-title .glitch-text {\n  position: relative;\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n\n.header-title .glitch-text::before,\n.header-title .glitch-text::after {\n  content: attr(data-text);\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  opacity: 0;\n}\n\n.header-title .glitch-text.glitching::before {\n  animation: glitchBefore 0.3s ease-in-out;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  opacity: 0.8;\n  clip-path: inset(20% 0 40% 0);\n}\n\n.header-title .glitch-text.glitching::after {\n  animation: glitchAfter 0.3s ease-in-out;\n  color: var(--magenta);\n  opacity: 0.8;\n  clip-path: inset(60% 0 10% 0);\n}\n\n@keyframes glitchBefore {\n  0% { transform: translate(0); }\n  20% { transform: translate(-3px, 2px); }\n  40% { transform: translate(3px, -1px); }\n  60% { transform: translate(-2px, 1px); }\n  80% { transform: translate(2px, -2px); }\n  100% { transform: translate(0); }\n}\n\n@keyframes glitchAfter {\n  0% { transform: translate(0); }\n  20% { transform: translate(3px, -2px); }\n  40% { transform: translate(-3px, 1px); }\n  60% { transform: translate(2px, -1px); }\n  80% { transform: translate(-2px, 2px); }\n  100% { transform: translate(0); }\n}\n\n.header-subtitle {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  letter-spacing: 3px;\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.header-right {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n.header-time {\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n}\n\n.header-date {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n/* GRID */\n.grid-container {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 20px 24px;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n  grid-template-rows: auto auto;\n  gap: 16px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n}\n\n/* PANEL BASE */\n.panel {\n  background: var(--bg-panel);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: border-color 0.3s;\n}\n\n.panel:hover {\n  border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);\n}\n\n/* Inward-cut top corners using clip-path */\n.panel::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--cyan), transparent);\n  opacity: 0.5;\n}\n\n.panel-header {\n  padding: 14px 18px 10px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n}\n\n.panel-title {\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 3px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--text-mid);\n}\n\n.panel-title .accent {\n  color: var(--cyan);\n}\n\n.panel-indicator {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: var(--green);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.panel-indicator .dot {\n  width: 5px;\n  height: 5px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--green);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 4px var(--green);\n}\n\n.panel-body {\n  padding: 16px 18px;\n}\n\n/* PANEL 1: CPU/RAM BARS */\n.telemetry-bars {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.telemetry-row {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.telemetry-label {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.telemetry-label .name {\n  color: var(--text-mid);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.telemetry-label .value {\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.telemetry-bar-track {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 8px;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.telemetry-bar-fill {\n  height: 100%;\n  position: relative;\n  transition: width 0.6s ease;\n  min-width: 2%;\n}\n\n.telemetry-bar-fill::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 0;\n  top: 0;\n  width: 2px;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: #fff;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 6px currentColor;\n}\n\n.bar-cpu { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), #00a0ff); color: var(--cyan); }\n.bar-ram { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--magenta), #ff44cc); color: var(--magenta); }\n.bar-gpu { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), #00cc44); color: var(--green); }\n.bar-net { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--yellow), var(--orange)); color: var(--yellow); }\n\n/* Circular gauges row */\n.gauges-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  padding-top: 14px;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n}\n\n.gauge-item {\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.gauge-svg {\n  width: 64px;\n  height: 64px;\n  transform: rotate(-90deg);\n}\n\n.gauge-bg {\n  fill: none;\n  stroke: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n  stroke-width: 4;\n}\n\n.gauge-fill {\n  fill: none;\n  stroke-width: 4;\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n  transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.6s ease;\n}\n\n.gauge-label {\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  margin-top: 6px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.gauge-value-text {\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n/* PANEL 2: TERMINAL */\n.terminal-panel {\n  grid-column: 1 / 3;\n}\n\n.terminal-body {\n  padding: 14px 18px;\n  height: 260px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  scrollbar-width: thin;\n  scrollbar-color: var(--border-color) transparent;\n}\n\n.terminal-body::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 4px;\n}\n\n.terminal-body::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: transparent;\n}\n\n.terminal-body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n}\n\n.terminal-line {\n  opacity: 0;\n  animation: terminalFadeIn 0.3s ease forwards;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n@keyframes terminalFadeIn {\n  to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n.terminal-line .timestamp {\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  margin-right: 8px;\n}\n\n.terminal-line .prefix {\n  color: var(--magenta);\n  margin-right: 6px;\n}\n\n.terminal-line .hex {\n  color: var(--green);\n}\n\n.terminal-line .msg {\n  color: var(--text-mid);\n}\n\n.terminal-line .warning {\n  color: var(--yellow);\n}\n\n.terminal-line .error {\n  color: var(--magenta);\n}\n\n.terminal-line .success {\n  color: var(--green);\n}\n\n.terminal-line .cyan {\n  color: var(--cyan);\n}\n\n.terminal-cursor {\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 7px;\n  height: 13px;\n  background: var(--cyan);\n  animation: cursorBlink 1s step-end infinite;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n  margin-left: 2px;\n}\n\n@keyframes cursorBlink {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  50% { opacity: 0; }\n}\n\n/* PANEL 3: NETWORK */\n.network-stats {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.network-stat-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n}\n\n.network-stat-row .stat-label {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.network-stat-row .stat-value {\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.network-stat-row .stat-unit {\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  margin-left: 4px;\n}\n\n/* Mini waveform */\n.waveform-container {\n  margin-top: 14px;\n  height: 50px;\n  position: relative;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.waveform-canvas {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n}\n\n/* PANEL 4: SYSTEM LOGS / NODES */\n.nodes-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.node-item {\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n  border-left: 2px solid var(--cyan);\n  transition: all 0.3s;\n}\n\n.node-item:hover {\n  background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03);\n  border-left-color: var(--magenta);\n}\n\n.node-item .node-name {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  color: var(--text-mid);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.node-item .node-status {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.node-item .node-status.online { color: var(--green); }\n.node-item .node-status.warning { color: var(--yellow); }\n.node-item .node-status.critical { color: var(--magenta); }\n\n.node-item .node-ping {\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  margin-top: 3px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n/* PANEL 5: FULL WIDTH BOTTOM */\n.full-width-panel {\n  grid-column: 1 / -1;\n}\n\n/* Hexagon grid decoration */\n.hex-decoration {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 10px;\n  right: 14px;\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 4px;\n  opacity: 0.3;\n}\n\n.hex-dot {\n  width: 4px;\n  height: 4px;\n  background: var(--cyan);\n  transform: rotate(45deg);\n}\n\n/* Corner decorations */\n.panel-corner {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 12px;\n  height: 12px;\n}\n\n.panel-corner.tl { top: -1px; left: -1px; border-top: 2px solid var(--cyan); border-left: 2px solid var(--cyan); }\n.panel-corner.tr { top: -1px; right: -1px; border-top: 2px solid var(--cyan); border-right: 2px solid var(--cyan); }\n.panel-corner.bl { bottom: -1px; left: -1px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--cyan); border-left: 2px solid var(--cyan); }\n.panel-corner.br { bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--cyan); border-right: 2px solid var(--cyan); }\n\n/* Alert bar */\n.alert-bar {\n  padding: 6px 18px;\n  background: rgba(255, 0, 170, 0.05);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 170, 0.1);\n  font-size: 10px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: var(--magenta);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.alert-bar .alert-icon {\n  animation: alertPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes alertPulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  50% { opacity: 0.3; }\n}\n\n/* Responsive */\n@media (max-width: 1100px) {\n  .grid-container {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  }\n  .terminal-panel {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n  }\n  .full-width-panel {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .sidebar {\n    width: 60px;\n    min-width: 60px;\n  }\n  .profile-name, .profile-role, .profile-status, .nav-label, .nav-btn span, .nav-btn .badge, .sidebar-footer {\n    display: none;\n  }\n  .nav-btn {\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 12px;\n  }\n  .grid-container {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .terminal-panel {\n    grid-column: 1;\n  }\n  .full-width-panel {\n    grid-column: 1;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Subtle background grid pattern */\n.main-content::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0; left: 0;\n  width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(rgba(0,240,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,240,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px);\n  background-size: 60px 60px;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n.grid-container {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n/* Scrollbar for main */\n.grid-container::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 4px;\n}\n.grid-container::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: transparent;\n}\n.grid-container::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Additional decorative elements */\n.scan-line {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 2px;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(0,240,255,0.08), transparent);\n  z-index: 9997;\n  animation: scanMove 8s linear infinite;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n@keyframes scanMove {\n  0% { top: -2px; }\n  100% { top: 100%; }\n}\n\n/* Panel data display */\n.data-display {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 20px;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.data-box {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.data-box .data-value {\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n.data-box .data-label {\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: var(--text-dim);\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.data-box .data-change {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.data-change.up { color: var(--green); }\n.data-change.down { color: var(--magenta); }\n\n/* Activity bars */\n.activity-bars {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  gap: 3px;\n  height: 40px;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.activity-bar {\n  flex: 1;\n  background: var(--cyan);\n  opacity: 0.6;\n  transition: height 0.4s ease;\n  min-width: 4px;\n}\n\n.activity-bar:nth-child(even) {\n  background: var(--magenta);\n}\n\n.activity-bar:nth-child(3n) {\n  background: var(--green);\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"scan-line\"></div>\n\n<!-- SIDEBAR -->\n<aside class=\"sidebar\">\n  <div class=\"profile-section\">\n    <div class=\"avatar-ring\">\n      <div class=\"avatar-inner\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"profile-name\">CMDR. NEXUS</div>\n    <div class=\"profile-role\">System Architect</div>\n    <div class=\"profile-status\">\n      <span class=\"status-dot\"></span>\n      <span>ONLINE \u2014 SECTOR 7G</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <nav class=\"nav-section\">\n    <div class=\"nav-label\">Navigation</div>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn active\">\n      <span class=\"nav-icon\">\u2b21</span>\n      <span>DASHBOARD</span>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\">\n      <span class=\"nav-icon\">\u25c8</span>\n      <span>TELEMETRY</span>\n      <span class=\"badge\">LIVE</span>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\">\n      <span class=\"nav-icon\">\u26a1</span>\n      <span>NETWORK</span>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\">\n      <span class=\"nav-icon\">\u25c9</span>\n      <span>SECURITY</span>\n      <span class=\"badge\">3</span>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\">\n      <span class=\"nav-icon\">\u2b22</span>\n      <span>QUANTUM LOGS</span>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\">\n      <span class=\"nav-icon\">\u22a1</span>\n      <span>CONFIG</span>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\">\n      <span class=\"nav-icon\">\u27d0</span>\n      <span>DIAGNOSTICS</span>\n    </button>\n  </nav>\n\n  <div class=\"sidebar-footer\">\n    <div class=\"version\">NEXUS OS v4.7.2-build.8841</div>\n    <div class=\"uptime\">UPTIME: <span id=\"uptimeVal\">00:00:00</span></div>\n  </div>\n</aside>\n\n<!-- MAIN CONTENT -->\n<main class=\"main-content\">\n  <!-- HEADER -->\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"header-left\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"header-title\">\n          <span class=\"glitch-text\" data-text=\"SYSTEM MONITOR\">SYSTEM MONITOR</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"header-subtitle\">Real-time telemetry dashboard // Quantum Core</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:right\">\n        <div class=\"header-time\" id=\"headerTime\">00:00:00</div>\n        <div class=\"header-date\" id=\"headerDate\">2025.01.01</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- ALERT BAR -->\n  <div class=\"alert-bar\">\n    <span class=\"alert-icon\">\u26a0</span>\n    <span>ALERT: UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS ATTEMPT DETECTED \u2014 NODE 4X-DELTA \u2014 PROTOCOL OMEGA ACTIVE</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- GRID -->\n  <div class=\"grid-container\">\n\n    <!-- PANEL 1: CPU/RAM LOAD -->\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner bl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner br\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <span class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"accent\">\u25a0</span> CPU / RAM LOAD</span>\n        <span class=\"panel-indicator\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> LIVE</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"panel-body\">\n        <div class=\"telemetry-bars\">\n          <div class=\"telemetry-row\">\n            <div class=\"telemetry-label\">\n              <span class=\"name\">CPU Core 0-7</span>\n              <span class=\"value\" id=\"cpuVal\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">0%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"telemetry-bar-track\">\n              <div class=\"telemetry-bar-fill bar-cpu\" id=\"cpuBar\" style=\"width:0%\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"telemetry-row\">\n            <div class=\"telemetry-label\">\n              <span class=\"name\">RAM Allocation</span>\n              <span class=\"value\" id=\"ramVal\" style=\"color:var(--magenta)\">0%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"telemetry-bar-track\">\n              <div class=\"telemetry-bar-fill bar-ram\" id=\"ramBar\" style=\"width:0%\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"telemetry-row\">\n            <div class=\"telemetry-label\">\n              <span class=\"name\">GPU Compute</span>\n              <span class=\"value\" id=\"gpuVal\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">0%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"telemetry-bar-track\">\n              <div class=\"telemetry-bar-fill bar-gpu\" id=\"gpuBar\" style=\"width:0%\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"telemetry-row\">\n            <div class=\"telemetry-label\">\n              <span class=\"name\">Network I/O</span>\n              <span class=\"value\" id=\"netVal\" style=\"color:var(--yellow)\">0%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"telemetry-bar-track\">\n              <div class=\"telemetry-bar-fill bar-net\" id=\"netBar\" style=\"width:0%\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"gauges-row\">\n          <div class=\"gauge-item\">\n            <svg class=\"gauge-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\">\n              <circle class=\"gauge-bg\" cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"15.5\"/>\n              <circle class=\"gauge-fill\" id=\"gauge1\" cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"15.5\"\n                stroke=\"var(--cyan)\" stroke-dasharray=\"97.4\" stroke-dashoffset=\"97.4\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"gauge-label\">Temp</div>\n            <div class=\"gauge-value-text\" id=\"gauge1Val\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">0\u00b0C</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"gauge-item\">\n            <svg class=\"gauge-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\">\n              <circle class=\"gauge-bg\" cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"15.5\"/>\n              <circle class=\"gauge-fill\" id=\"gauge2\" cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"15.5\"\n                stroke=\"var(--magenta)\" stroke-dasharray=\"97.4\" stroke-dashoffset=\"97.4\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"gauge-label\">Voltage</div>\n            <div class=\"gauge-value-text\" id=\"gauge2Val\" style=\"color:var(--magenta)\">0V</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"gauge-item\">\n            <svg class=\"gauge-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\">\n              <circle class=\"gauge-bg\" cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"15.5\"/>\n              <circle class=\"gauge-fill\" id=\"gauge3\" cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"15.5\"\n                stroke=\"var(--green)\" stroke-dasharray=\"97.4\" stroke-dashoffset=\"97.4\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"gauge-label\">Clock</div>\n            <div class=\"gauge-value-text\" id=\"gauge3Val\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">0GHz</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- PANEL 2: TERMINAL -->\n    <div class=\"panel terminal-panel\">\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner bl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner br\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <span class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"accent\">\u25a0</span> SYSTEM TERMINAL</span>\n        <span class=\"panel-indicator\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> STREAMING</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\" id=\"terminalBody\">\n        <div class=\"terminal-line\">\n          <span class=\"timestamp\">[SYS]</span>\n          <span class=\"prefix\">root@nexus:~$</span>\n          <span class=\"success\">Initializing quantum telemetry interface...</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- PANEL 3: NETWORK -->\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner bl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner br\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <span class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"accent\">\u25a0</span> NETWORK</span>\n        <span class=\"panel-indicator\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> ACTIVE</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"panel-body\">\n        <div class=\"network-stats\">\n          <div class=\"network-stat-row\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Inbound</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"netIn\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">0.00</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-unit\">Gbps</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"network-stat-row\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Outbound</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"netOut\" style=\"color:var(--magenta)\">0.00</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-unit\">Gbps</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"network-stat-row\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Packet Loss</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"pktLoss\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">0.00%</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"network-stat-row\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Latency</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"latency\" style=\"color:var(--yellow)\">0ms</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"network-stat-row\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Active Connections</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"conns\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">0</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"waveform-container\">\n          <canvas class=\"waveform-canvas\" id=\"waveformCanvas\"></canvas>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- PANEL 4: NODES -->\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner bl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner br\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <span class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"accent\">\u25a0</span> ACTIVE NODES</span>\n        <span class=\"panel-indicator\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> 8/8 ONLINE</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"panel-body\">\n        <div class=\"nodes-grid\" id=\"nodesGrid\">\n          <div class=\"node-item\">\n            <div class=\"node-name\">NODE-ALPHA-01</div>\n            <div class=\"node-status online\">\u25cf ONLINE</div>\n            <div class=\"node-ping\">PING: 2ms</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"node-item\">\n            <div class=\"node-name\">NODE-BETA-02</div>\n            <div class=\"node-status online\">\u25cf ONLINE</div>\n            <div class=\"node-ping\">PING: 4ms</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"node-item\">\n            <div class=\"node-name\">NODE-GAMMA-03</div>\n            <div class=\"node-status online\">\u25cf ONLINE</div>\n            <div class=\"node-ping\">PING: 7ms</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"node-item\">\n            <div class=\"node-name\">NODE-DELTA-04</div>\n            <div class=\"node-status warning\">\u25cf DEGRADED</div>\n            <div class=\"node-ping\">PING: 45ms</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"node-item\">\n            <div class=\"node-name\">NODE-EPSILON-05</div>\n            <div class=\"node-status online\">\u25cf ONLINE</div>\n            <div class=\"node-ping\">PING: 3ms</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"node-item\">\n            <div class=\"node-name\">NODE-ZETA-06</div>\n            <div class=\"node-status online\">\u25cf ONLINE</div>\n            <div class=\"node-ping\">PING: 5ms</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"node-item\">\n            <div class=\"node-name\">NODE-ETA-07</div>\n            <div class=\"node-status online\">\u25cf ONLINE</div>\n            <div class=\"node-ping\">PING: 1ms</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"node-item\">\n            <div class=\"node-name\">NODE-THETA-08</div>\n            <div class=\"node-status online\">\u25cf ONLINE</div>\n            <div class=\"node-ping\">PING: 6ms</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- PANEL 5: SYSTEM OVERVIEW (FULL WIDTH) -->\n    <div class=\"panel full-width-panel\">\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner tr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner bl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-corner br\"></div>\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <span class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"accent\">\u25a0</span> SYSTEM OVERVIEW</span>\n        <span class=\"panel-indicator\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> NOMINAL</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"panel-body\">\n        <div class=\"data-display\">\n          <div class=\"data-box\">\n            <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"totalProcesses\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"data-label\">Processes</div>\n            <div class=\"data-change up\">\u25b2 +3 since last check</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"data-box\">\n            <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"diskUsage\" style=\"color:var(--magenta)\">0%</div>\n            <div class=\"data-label\">Disk Usage</div>\n            <div class=\"data-change down\">\u25bc 2.1GB freed</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"data-box\">\n            <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"memoryUsed\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">0 GB</div>\n            <div class=\"data-label\">Memory Used</div>\n            <div class=\"data-change up\">\u25b2 1.2GB allocated</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"data-box\">\n            <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"threatLevel\" style=\"color:var(--yellow)\">LOW</div>\n            <div class=\"data-label\">Threat Level</div>\n            <div class=\"data-change\">\u2014 STABLE</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"data-box\">\n            <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"activeFirewall\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">ACTIVE</div>\n            <div class=\"data-label\">Firewall</div>\n            <div class=\"data-change up\">\u25b2 247 rules loaded</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"activity-bars\" id=\"activityBars\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n// === CLOCK ===\nfunction updateClock() {\n  const now = new Date();\n  const h = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, '0');\n  const m = String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0');\n  const s = String(now.getSeconds()).padStart(2, '0');\n  document.getElementById('headerTime').textContent = `${h}:${m}:${s}`;\n  const y = now.getFullYear();\n  const mo = String(now.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');\n  const d = String(now.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');\n  document.getElementById('headerDate').textContent = `${y}.${mo}.${d}`;\n}\nsetInterval(updateClock, 1000);\nupdateClock();\n\n// === UPTIME ===\nlet uptimeSeconds = 0;\nfunction updateUptime() {\n  uptimeSeconds++;\n  const h = String(Math.floor(uptimeSeconds / 3600)).padStart(2, '0');\n  const m = String(Math.floor((uptimeSeconds % 3600) / 60)).padStart(2, '0');\n  const s = String(uptimeSeconds % 60).padStart(2, '0');\n  document.getElementById('uptimeVal').textContent = `${h}:${m}:${s}`;\n}\nsetInterval(updateUptime, 1000);\n\n// === GLITCH EFFECT ===\nconst glitchText = document.querySelector('.glitch-text');\nfunction triggerGlitch() {\n  glitchText.classList.add('glitching');\n  setTimeout(() => glitchText.classList.remove('glitching'), 300);\n  // Random next trigger between 3-10 seconds\n  setTimeout(triggerGlitch, 3000 + Math.random() * 7000);\n}\nsetTimeout(triggerGlitch, 2000);\n\n// === TELEMETRY BARS ===\nfunction randomBetween(min, max) {\n  return Math.floor(Math.random() * (max - min + 1)) + min;\n}\n\nfunction updateTelemetry() {\n  const cpu = randomBetween(25, 95);\n  const ram = randomBetween(40, 88);\n  const gpu = randomBetween(15, 80);\n  const net = randomBetween(10, 70);\n\n  document.getElementById('cpuBar').style.width = cpu + '%';\n  document.getElementById('cpuVal').textContent = cpu + '%';\n\n  document.getElementById('ramBar').style.width = ram + '%';\n  document.getElementById('ramVal').textContent = ram + '%';\n\n  document.getElementById('gpuBar').style.width = gpu + '%';\n  document.getElementById('gpuVal').textContent = gpu + '%';\n\n  document.getElementById('netBar').style.width = net + '%';\n  document.getElementById('netVal').textContent = net + '%';\n\n  // Gauges\n  const circumference = 97.4;\n  const temp = randomBetween(35, 82);\n  const tempOffset = circumference - (temp / 100) * circumference;\n  document.getElementById('gauge1').style.strokeDashoffset = tempOffset;\n  document.getElementById('gauge1Val').textContent = temp + '\u00b0C';\n\n  const volt = randomBetween(110, 140);\n  const voltPct = (volt - 100) / 60;\n  const voltOffset = circumference - Math.min(voltPct, 1) * circumference;\n  document.getElementById('gauge2').style.strokeDashoffset = voltOffset;\n  document.getElementById('gauge2Val').textContent = volt + 'V';\n\n  const clock = (randomBetween(30, 55) / 10).toFixed(1);\n  const clockPct = parseFloat(clock) / 6;\n  const clockOffset = circumference - Math.min(clockPct, 1) * circumference;\n  document.getElementById('gauge3').style.strokeDashoffset = clockOffset;\n  document.getElementById('gauge3Val').textContent = clock + 'GHz';\n}\n\nsetInterval(updateTelemetry, 800);\nupdateTelemetry();\n\n// === TERMINAL ===\nconst terminalMessages = [\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Scanning quantum entanglement channels...' },\n  { type: 'warning', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'BYPASSING SECURITY PROTOCOL DELTA-7...' },\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Handshake verified \u2014 node synchronization complete' },\n  { type: 'error', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'ANOMALY DETECTED in sector 0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 4).toUpperCase() },\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Encrypting data stream with AES-512 quantum cipher' },\n  { type: 'success', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Firewall rule #247 applied \u2014 threat neutralized' },\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Re-routing through proxy cluster 7G-alpha...' },\n  { type: 'warning', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Unidentified signal on port 8443 \u2014 monitoring...' },\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Deep packet inspection: payload size 4096 bytes' },\n  { type: 'error', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'INTRUSION ATTEMPT blocked \u2014 source: 192.168.0.' + randomBetween(1,255) },\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Quantum key distribution: keys rotated successfully' },\n  { type: 'success', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Backup snapshot created \u2014 checksum verified' },\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'DNS tunneling attempt detected and quarantined' },\n  { type: 'warning', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Certificate expiry warning \u2014 14 days remaining' },\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Harvesting telemetry data from 8 active nodes' },\n  { type: 'success', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'System integrity check passed \u2014 all subsystems nominal' },\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Loading neural network weights from cold storage...' },\n  { type: 'error', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Memory leak detected in process PID ' + randomBetween(1000, 9999) },\n  { type: 'info', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Compacting quantum database shards...' },\n  { type: 'warning', hex: '0x' + Math.random().toString(16).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase(), msg: 'Rate limiting activated \u2014 1049 requests/sec threshold' },\n];\n\nconst terminalBody = document.getElementById('terminalBody');\n\nfunction addTerminalLine() {\n  const msg = terminalMessages[randomBetween(0, terminalMessages.length - 1)];\n  const now = new Date();\n  const ts = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, '0') + ':' +\n             String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0') + ':' +\n             String(now.getSeconds()).padStart(2, '0');\n\n  const line = document.createElement('div');\n  line.className = 'terminal-line';\n\n  let colorClass = 'msg';\n  if (msg.type === 'warning') colorClass = 'warning';\n  if (msg.type === 'error') colorClass = 'error';\n  if (msg.type === 'success') colorClass = 'success';\n\n  line.innerHTML = `\n    <span class=\"timestamp\">[${ts}]</span>\n    <span class=\"hex\">${msg.hex}</span>\n    <span class=\"${colorClass}\"> ${msg.msg}</span>\n  `;\n\n  terminalBody.appendChild(line);\n\n  // Keep max 50 lines\n  while (terminalBody.children.length > 50) {\n    terminalBody.removeChild(terminalBody.firstChild);\n  }\n\n  terminalBody.scrollTop = terminalBody.scrollHeight;\n}\n\n// Initial lines\nfor (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n  setTimeout(() => addTerminalLine(), i * 200);\n}\nsetInterval(addTerminalLine, 600 + Math.random() * 400);\n\n// === NETWORK STATS ===\nfunction updateNetwork() {\n  const netIn = (Math.random() * 4 + 0.5).toFixed(2);\n  const netOut = (Math.random() * 3 + 0.3).toFixed(2);\n  const pktLoss = (Math.random() * 2).toFixed(2);\n  const latency = randomBetween(1, 28);\n  const conns = randomBetween(1200, 4800);\n\n  document.getElementById('netIn').textContent = netIn;\n  document.getElementById('netOut').textContent = netOut;\n  document.getElementById('pktLoss').textContent = pktLoss + '%';\n  document.getElementById('latency').textContent = latency + 'ms';\n  document.getElementById('conns').textContent = conns.toLocaleString();\n}\nsetInterval(updateNetwork, 800);\nupdateNetwork();\n\n// === WAVEFORM CANVAS ===\nconst waveCanvas = document.getElementById('waveformCanvas');\nconst waveCtx = waveCanvas.getContext('2d');\nlet waveData = [];\nfor (let i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\n  waveData.push(Math.random() * 30 + 10);\n}\n\nfunction resizeWaveCanvas() {\n  const container = waveCanvas.parentElement;\n  waveCanvas.width = container.clientWidth;\n  waveCanvas.height = container.clientHeight;\n}\nresizeWaveCanvas();\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', resizeWaveCanvas);\n\nfunction drawWaveform() {\n  const w = waveCanvas.width;\n  const h = waveCanvas.height;\n  waveCtx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n  // Shift data\n  waveData.shift();\n  waveData.push(Math.random() * 35 + 5);\n\n  // Draw fill\n  waveCtx.beginPath();\n  waveCtx.moveTo(0, h);\n  for (let i = 0; i < waveData.length; i++) {\n    const x = (i / waveData.length) * w;\n    const y = h - (waveData[i] / 50) * h;\n    if (i === 0) waveCtx.lineTo(x, y);\n    else {\n      const prevX = ((i - 1) / waveData.length) * w;\n      const prevY = h - (waveData[i - 1] / 50) * h;\n      const cpX = (prevX + x) / 2;\n      waveCtx.quadraticCurveTo(prevX, prevY, cpX, (prevY + y) / 2);\n    }\n  }\n  waveCtx.lineTo(w, h);\n  waveCtx.closePath();\n\n  const grad = waveCtx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, w, 0);\n  grad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15)');\n  grad.addColorStop(0.5, 'rgba(255, 0, 170, 0.1)');\n  grad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.15)');\n  waveCtx.fillStyle = grad;\n  waveCtx.fill();\n\n  // Draw line\n  waveCtx.beginPath();\n  for (let i = 0; i < waveData.length; i++) {\n    const x = (i / waveData.length) * w;\n    const y = h - (waveData[i] / 50) * h;\n    if (i === 0) waveCtx.moveTo(x, y);\n    else {\n      const prevX = ((i - 1) / waveData.length) * w;\n      const prevY = h - (waveData[i - 1] / 50) * h;\n      const cpX = (prevX + x) / 2;\n      waveCtx.quadraticCurveTo(prevX, prevY, cpX, (prevY + y) / 2);\n    }\n  }\n  waveCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.7)';\n  waveCtx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n  waveCtx.stroke();\n\n  // Grid lines\n  waveCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.03)';\n  waveCtx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n  for (let i = 1; i < 4; i++) {\n    const y = (h / 4) * i;\n    waveCtx.beginPath();\n    waveCtx.moveTo(0, y);\n    waveCtx.lineTo(w, y);\n    waveCtx.stroke();\n  }\n}\n\nsetInterval(drawWaveform, 100);\n\n// === SYSTEM OVERVIEW VALUES ===\nfunction updateSystemOverview() {\n  const processes = randomBetween(247, 389);\n  const disk = randomBetween(62, 78);\n  const mem = (Math.random() * 8 + 12).toFixed(1);\n\n  document.getElementById('totalProcesses').textContent = processes;\n  document.getElementById('diskUsage').textContent = disk + '%';\n  document.getElementById('memoryUsed').textContent = mem + ' GB';\n}\nsetInterval(updateSystemOverview, 2000);\nupdateSystemOverview();\n\n// === ACTIVITY BARS ===\nconst activityBarsContainer = document.getElementById('activityBars');\nfor (let i = 0; i < 40; i++) {\n  const bar = document.createElement('div');\n  bar.className = 'activity-bar';\n  bar.style.height = randomBetween(5, 35) + 'px';\n  activityBarsContainer.appendChild(bar);\n}\n\nfunction updateActivityBars() {\n  const bars = activityBarsContainer.children;\n  for (let i = 0; i < bars.length; i++) {\n    bars[i].style.height = randomBetween(5, 38) + 'px';\n  }\n}\nsetInterval(updateActivityBars, 500);\n\n// === NODE STATUS UPDATES ===\nfunction updateNodes() {\n  const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('.node-item');\n  const statuses = ['online', 'online', 'online', 'online', 'online', 'online', 'warning', 'online'];\n  const statusTexts = {\n    online: '\u25cf ONLINE',\n    warning: '\u25cf DEGRADED',\n    critical: '\u25cf CRITICAL'\n  };\n\n  nodes.forEach((node, i) => {\n    const statusEl = node.querySelector('.node-status');\n    const pingEl = node.querySelector('.node-ping');\n    const status = statuses[i];\n    statusEl.className = 'node-status ' + status;\n    statusEl.textContent = statusTexts[status];\n    const ping = status === 'online' ? randomBetween(1, 12) : randomBetween(20, 80);\n    pingEl.textContent = 'PING: ' + ping + 'ms';\n  });\n}\nsetInterval(updateNodes, 3000);\n\n// === NAV BUTTON INTERACTION ===\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.nav-btn').forEach(btn => {\n  btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.nav-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n    this.classList.add('active');\n  });\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
